    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n18 Fernwood Close is a well-presented three-bedroom home situated on a private cul-de-sac. \n\nPresented in good decorative condition throughout, the property offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a home in the mature residential location of Doughcloyne. \n\nAccommodation, in brief, extends to an entrance hall, WC, living room, sitting room, utility room and kitchen/ dining room, which are all situated on ground floor level. The first floor boasts three bedrooms, with the main bedroom having an ensuite and a family bathroom. \n\nThe large driveway to the front provides ample room for parking. Access to the rear of the garden can be gained via the side gate. \n\nThe rear enclosed garden is laid out in lawn and is very well maintained. \n\nFernwood Close is primely located within close proximity to UCC, MTU, the CUH, Wilton Shopping Centre and the South Link Road network. Wilton and its immediate surrounding area also offers all other local and social amenities on its doorstep to include banks, churches, schools, etc. \n\nThis property is a fantastic chance to acquire a well-kept family home. \n\nDon't delay, arrange your viewing today!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.81m x 4.01m\nA bright and welcoming entrance hall with wooden flooring.\n\nW.C - 1.16m x 1.82m\nWC with a two-piece suite and lino flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 3.64m x 5.26m\nComfortable reception room with large bay window. It also features a built-in stove.\n\nSitting Room - 3.39m x 3.96m\nIdeal additional living space/home office or kids' playroom. Looks onto the private rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 1.61m x 1.52m\nPlumbed for washing machine and dryer. The back garden can be accessed from this area. Tiled flooring.\n\nKitchen/ Dining Room - 3.12m x 5.83m\nFully fitted with eye and floor level kitchen units with all appliances. Tiled floor throughout and over counter splashback. The dining area acts as an additional gateway to the rear garden. Velux window overhead provides extra light to the dining area.\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 3.04m x 2.36m\nThe landing opens to all bedrooms and the family bathroom. Hot press storage.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.91m x 3.69m\nBright double bedroom to the rear of the property with wooden flooring.\n\nEnsuite - 0.98m x 2.29m\nThree-piece shower suite with electric shower fitting. Fully tiled walls and floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.70m x 5.26m\nLarge double bedroom to the front with bay window and ample built-in wooden wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.96m x 2.86m\nSingle bedroom with wooden flooring.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.27m x 1.74m\nFully tiled family bathroom with three-piece suite. Bathtub and electric shower fitting overhead.\n\n"
      },
      {
